hr_recruiter.body:
Hello {recruiter_name},

I came across the job opportunity for {job_title} ({job_link}) from your team, which matches my expertise in {domain_or_industry}.

My background is in {skill_1}, {skill_2}, and {skill_3}, which directly aligns with the role requirements. More importantly, I take genuine ownership rather than approaching software like a checkbox task. I bring a mix of {ownership_trait_1}, {ownership_trait_2}, and a sharp understanding of {domain_area_1} and {domain_area_2}, allowing me to solve engineering problems with a broader, more strategic lens.

I would love to hear your perspective on what makes someone successful in this role. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute coffee chat this week?

I understand your calendar may be packed, but even a brief pointer to the hiring team would mean a lot.

Regards,
{candidate_name}
{candidate_linkedin}
{candidate_phone}

